    - Term: UI/7Jis67CU66W07KeAIOyViuydgCDsnbjspp0g7JqU7LKt7J6F64uI64ukLiDqsozsnoTsnLzroZwg64-M7JWE6rCAIOuLpOyLnCDsi5zrj4TtlZjshLjsmpQu
      TermType: 0
      Description: "\uC62C\uBC14\uB974\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC740 \uC778\uC99D \uC694\uCCAD\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
